;;
;; What the ELF actually enters is FUNCTION 0, not the loop node: the
;; glue zeroes the register file and calls the image's first function,
;; whose whole body is the loop. These two corollaries lift the walk
;; theorems across that boundary — the shape M3's bin equation takes,
;; and the reason the entry costs exactly TWO more fuel units (the seq
;; peel plus the XLoop instruction's own).
(claim scp_main_eof
